# Every text file is checked out with LF, on Windows too (whatever core.autocrlf says). Prettier and
# ruff write LF, so a checkout with CRLF made `npm run format` mark dozens of unchanged files as
# modified. Binary files (images, .mo) are detected by `text=auto` and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers: never check them out with CRLF
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
nginx.conf text eol=lf
